        "official_en_sha256": "901d31d7a30dca88c3604cd22af5c106ff326cfc618b622b246e2516a3515d25"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この街、意外とのどかな雰囲気よね。\r\nもっと厳かな感じだと思ってたわ。",
        "official_en": "This city is more peaceful and laid-back than I imagined. I thought it’d be, y’know, more...hoity-toity.",
        "real_en": "This city feels surprisingly peaceful. I thought it would be more solemn."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
