      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "こんなにキレイな水なら\r\n泳いだら気持ちよさそうだよね。",
        "official_en": "See how clean and clear the water is? I really wanted to go swim in it.",
        "real_en": "With water this clear, swimming in it must feel great."
      },
